    "Warmup is discarded, the median of the measured rounds is reported, and the 95% confidence interval comes from bootstrap resampling. The index is the geometric mean of each core subtest relative to the first qualified local run." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Warmup is discarded, the median of the measured rounds is reported, and the 95% confidence interval comes from bootstrap resampling. The index is the geometric mean of each core subtest relative to the first qualified local run."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "预热样本会被丢弃，结果取各轮中位数，95% 置信区间由自助重采样得出。指数是各核心子测试相对首次合格本机基线的几何平均。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "預熱樣本會被丟棄，結果取各輪中位數，95% 信賴區間由自助重抽樣得出。指數是各核心子測試相對首次合格本機基準的幾何平均。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "預熱樣本會被丟棄，結果取各輪中位數，95% 信賴區間由自助重抽樣得出。指數是各核心子測試相對首次合格本機基準的幾何平均。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "預熱樣本會被丟棄，結果取各輪中位數，95% 信賴區間由自助重抽樣得出。指數是各核心子測試相對首次合格本機基準的幾何平均。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
